#. TRANSLATORS: a step: the device was connected a moment ago and is not ready yet for the
#. USB session openExpress opens of its own
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Waiting for the device to get ready…"
msgstr "Czekanie, aż urządzenie będzie gotowe…"

#. TRANSLATORS: a step: openExpress reads folders of the device through a direct USB
#. connection, also those the device hides from the file manager; {folder}: the folders of the
#. top level they are in, e.g. .System or GARMIN
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Reading the folder {folder}…"
msgstr "Odczytywanie folderu {folder}…"

#. TRANSLATORS: {folder}: a folder the device hides from the file manager, e.g.
#. .System
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Flatpak version has no access to USB devices, so it cannot read the "
"folder {folder}. Give it the permission (see the README) or use the version "
"from source."
msgstr ""
"Wersja Flatpak nie ma dostępu do urządzeń USB, więc nie może odczytać "
"folderu {folder}. Nadaj jej to uprawnienie (patrz README) albo użyj wersji "
"ze źródeł."

#. TRANSLATORS: {folder}: a folder the device hides from the file manager, e.g. .System
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"openExpress cannot open a direct USB connection to this device, so it cannot "
"read the folder {folder}."
msgstr ""
"openExpress nie może otworzyć bezpośredniego połączenia USB z tym "
"urządzeniem, więc nie odczyta folderu {folder}."

#. TRANSLATORS: {name} is an update, e.g. "Time Zone Map"; its old file was deleted before
#. the new one was written, as Garmin Express does, and the new one failed
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name} was not written: its old file was removed and the new one is not on "
"the device. Nothing else was changed; install it again."
msgstr ""
"Nie zapisano: {name}. Stary plik usunięto, a nowego nie ma na urządzeniu. "
"Niczego więcej nie zmieniono; zainstaluj aktualizację ponownie."

#. TRANSLATORS: {name} is an update, e.g. "Time Zone Map"
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name} was not written; nothing of it is on the device and nothing else was "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Nie zapisano: {name}. Nic z tej aktualizacji nie trafiło na urządzenie "
"i niczego więcej nie zmieniono."

#. TRANSLATORS: {name} is an update, e.g. "Time Zone Map", written into a folder the device
#. hides; the device refused to give it back, so its bytes were not checked
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name} was written and has the right size, but the device did not let "
"openExpress read it back, so its contents were not compared. openExpress "
"stops here and writes nothing else."
msgstr ""
"Zapisano: {name} – rozmiar się zgadza, ale urządzenie nie pozwoliło "
"openExpressowi odczytać pliku, więc jego zawartości nie porównano. "
"openExpress na tym kończy i niczego więcej nie zapisuje."

#. TRANSLATORS: {needed} and {free} are sizes; the old file of the update counts as free, as
#. it is removed before the new one is written
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Not enough space for {name}: {needed} needed, {free} free with its old file "
"counted. openExpress removes nothing else to make room."
msgstr ""
"Za mało miejsca na {name}: potrzeba {needed}, wolne {free} wraz ze starym "
"plikiem. openExpress nie usuwa niczego innego, aby zrobić miejsce."

#. TRANSLATORS: {folder}: e.g. .System/Map
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The folder {folder} is not on the device, and openExpress does not create "
"folders there."
msgstr ""
"Folderu {folder} nie ma na urządzeniu; openExpress nie zakłada tam folderów."

#. TRANSLATORS: {name} is an update; openExpress copies the file on the device to this
#. computer before it writes the new one, and that copy failed
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name} was not written: the file there now could not be copied whole to this "
"computer first. Nothing on the device was changed."
msgstr ""
"Nie zapisano: {name}. Obecnego pliku nie udało się najpierw skopiować "
"w całości na ten komputer. Niczego na urządzeniu nie zmieniono."

#. TRANSLATORS: a step of writing an update into a folder the device hides: a small file
#. written there, read back and deleted, before anything there is replaced
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Trying a small test file in {folder}…"
msgstr "Próba z małym plikiem testowym w {folder}…"

#. TRANSLATORS: a step of writing an update into a folder the device hides; {name}: an
#. update, whose file now on the device is copied to this computer before it is replaced
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Copying the old {name} to this computer"
msgstr "Kopiowanie poprzedniego pliku ({name}) na ten komputer"

#. TRANSLATORS: a step of writing an update into a folder the device hides; {name}: an update
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Removing the old {name} from the device"
msgstr "Usuwanie poprzedniego pliku ({name}) z urządzenia"

#. TRANSLATORS: a step of writing an update into a folder the device hides; {name}: an
#. update whose new file was not written whole, so its old one is written back from the copy
#. on this computer
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Putting the old {name} back on the device"
msgstr "Przywracanie poprzedniego pliku ({name}) na urządzenie"

#. TRANSLATORS: {name} is an update; before it replaces anything, openExpress writes a small
#. test file into the folder the device hides, reads it back and deletes it
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name} was not written: the device did not take a small test file into that "
"folder, so the file there now was left as it is."
msgstr ""
"Nie zapisano: {name}. Urządzenie nie przyjęło do tego folderu małego pliku "
"testowego, więc obecny plik został bez zmian."

#. TRANSLATORS: after an update was not written into a folder the device hides, the file that
#. was there before was written back from its copy on this computer
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The file that was there before was put back and read back the same."
msgstr "Poprzedni plik przywrócono i po odczycie jest taki sam."

#. TRANSLATORS: after an update was not written into a folder the device hides; {path}:
#. the copy on this computer of the file that was there before; {sha256}: its checksum
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The file that was there before was put back and read back the same as its "
"copy ({path}, SHA-256 {sha256})."
msgstr ""
"Poprzedni plik przywrócono i po odczycie jest taki sam jak jego kopia "
"({path}, SHA-256 {sha256})."

#. TRANSLATORS: after an update was not written into a folder the device hides; {path}: the
#. copy on this computer of the file that was there before; {sha256}: its checksum
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The file that was there before could not be put back; its copy is at {path} "
"(SHA-256 {sha256})."
msgstr ""
"Poprzedniego pliku nie udało się przywrócić; jego kopia jest w {path} "
"(SHA-256 {sha256})."

#. TRANSLATORS: {name} is a map; it was being written into a folder the device hides and
#. stopped: {done} of its {count} files are on the device (the verb agrees with {done})
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name} is incomplete on the device: {done} of {count} files was written. "
"Nothing else was removed, and the downloaded files stay on this computer: "
"install it again and only what is missing is written."
msgid_plural ""
"{name} is incomplete on the device: {done} of {count} files were written. "
"Nothing else was removed, and the downloaded files stay on this computer: "
"install it again and only what is missing is written."
msgstr[0] ""
"Mapa {name} jest na urządzeniu niepełna: zapisano {done} z {count} plików. "
"Niczego więcej nie usunięto, a pobrane pliki zostają na tym komputerze: "
"zainstaluj ją ponownie, a zapisane zostanie tylko to, czego brakuje."
msgstr[1] ""
"Mapa {name} jest na urządzeniu niepełna: zapisano {done} z {count} plików. "
"Niczego więcej nie usunięto, a pobrane pliki zostają na tym komputerze: "
"zainstaluj ją ponownie, a zapisane zostanie tylko to, czego brakuje."
msgstr[2] ""
"Mapa {name} jest na urządzeniu niepełna: zapisano {done} z {count} plików. "
"Niczego więcej nie usunięto, a pobrane pliki zostają na tym komputerze: "
"zainstaluj ją ponownie, a zapisane zostanie tylko to, czego brakuje."

#. TRANSLATORS: {name} is a map; {needed} and {free} are sizes; its old files and those it
#. writes over count as free, as they are removed first
#: openexpress/hidden_folders.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Not enough space for {name}: {needed} needed, {free} free with its old files "
"counted. openExpress removes nothing else to make room."
msgstr ""
"Za mało miejsca na {name}: potrzeba {needed}, wolne {free} wraz z jej "
"starymi plikami. openExpress nie usuwa niczego innego, aby zrobić miejsce."

