"The map files are on the device, but its unlock file {path} could not be "
"written ({error}). The device may still load the map after it is unplugged; "
"if it does not, come back to this page."
msgstr ""
"Pliki mapy są na urządzeniu, ale nie udało się zapisać jej pliku "
