#. TRANSLATORS: a step of the Updates page: a file on the device of the size Garmin offers is
#. read whole to compare it with the server's ("… · 12.3 MB of 61.8 MB"); short, so that the
#. numbers fit the bar of the narrowest window
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Checking the update file"
msgstr "Odczyt pliku aktualizacji"

#. TRANSLATORS: `openexpress updates --reinstalls`, under a component whose version on
#. the device ({on_device}) is higher than the one Garmin offers ({offered}), while the
#. file on the device is the very file offered
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "On the device {on_device}, Garmin offers {offered}: the same file."
msgstr "Na urządzeniu {on_device}, Garmin oferuje {offered}: ten sam plik."

#. TRANSLATORS: `openexpress updates --reinstalls`, under a component whose version on
#. the device ({on_device}) is higher than the one Garmin offers ({offered}); its file is
#. in a folder the device hides, so only its size was compared
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On the device {on_device}, Garmin offers {offered}: the same size, its "
"contents not compared."
msgstr ""
"Na urządzeniu {on_device}, Garmin oferuje {offered}: ten sam rozmiar, treści "
"nie porównano."

#. TRANSLATORS: `openexpress updates --reinstalls`, under a component whose version on
#. the device ({on_device}) is higher than the one Garmin offers ({offered}), while the
#. file on the device is another: an older version, which openExpress never writes over
#. the device's
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On the device {on_device}, Garmin offers {offered}, an older version: not "
"reinstalled."
msgstr ""
"Na urządzeniu {on_device}, Garmin oferuje {offered}, starszą wersję: bez "
"ponownej instalacji."

#. TRANSLATORS: `openexpress updates --reinstalls`, under a component whose version on
#. the device ({on_device}) is higher than the one Garmin offers ({offered}), while its
#. file could not be compared with the one offered (not on the device, its folder not read)
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On the device {on_device}, Garmin offers {offered}, an older version; the "
"file on the device could not be compared: not reinstalled."
msgstr ""
"Na urządzeniu {on_device}, Garmin oferuje {offered}, starszą wersję; pliku "
"na urządzeniu nie udało się porównać: bez ponownej instalacji."

#. TRANSLATORS: Updates page, in the row of a component whose version on the device
#. ({on_device}) is higher than the one Garmin offers ({offered}), while the file on the
#. device is the very file offered; no full stop
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "On the device {on_device} · Garmin offers {offered}, the same file"
msgstr "Na urządzeniu {on_device} · Garmin oferuje {offered}, ten sam plik"

#. TRANSLATORS: Updates page, in the row of a component whose version on the device
#. ({on_device}) is higher than the one Garmin offers ({offered}); its file is in a folder
#. the device hides, so only its size was compared; no full stop
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "On the device {on_device} · Garmin offers {offered}, the same size"
msgstr "Na urządzeniu {on_device} · Garmin oferuje {offered}, ten sam rozmiar"

#. TRANSLATORS: Updates page, in the row of a component whose version on the device
#. ({on_device}) is higher than the one Garmin offers ({offered}), while the file on the
#. device is another: an older version, which openExpress does not reinstall (the row has
#. no button); no full stop
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "On the device {on_device} · Garmin offers {offered}, an older version"
msgstr "Na urządzeniu {on_device} · Garmin oferuje {offered}, starszą wersję"

#. TRANSLATORS: Updates page, in the row of a component whose version on the device
#. ({on_device}) is higher than the one Garmin offers ({offered}), while its file could
#. not be compared with the one offered; no full stop
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On the device {on_device} · Garmin offers {offered}, an older version; the "
"file on the device could not be compared"
msgstr ""
"Na urządzeniu {on_device} · Garmin oferuje {offered}, starszą wersję; pliku "
"na urządzeniu nie udało się porównać"

#. TRANSLATORS: `openexpress updates`: an update openExpress does not install; {folder}: the
#. folder of the device's top level its file goes to, e.g. .System
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Not installed: {name} {version} goes to the folder {folder}, which "
"openExpress cannot see on the device."
msgstr ""
"Nie zainstalowano: {name} {version} trafia do folderu {folder}, którego "
"openExpress nie widzi na urządzeniu."

#. TRANSLATORS: `openexpress updates`: an update not installed because openExpress cannot
#. reach the folder its file goes to; {folder}: that folder, which the device hides from the
#. file manager, e.g. GARMIN/Prompts
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Not installed: {name} {version} goes to the folder {folder}, which the "
"device hides from the file manager, and openExpress cannot open a direct USB "
"connection to this device to write there (the Flatpak version needs access "
"to USB devices for it, see the README). The other updates install as usual."
msgstr ""
"Nie zainstalowano: {name} {version} trafia do folderu {folder}, który "
"urządzenie ukrywa przed menedżerem plików, a openExpress nie może otworzyć "
"bezpośredniego połączenia USB z tym urządzeniem, aby tam zapisać (wersja "
"Flatpak potrzebuje do tego dostępu do urządzeń USB, patrz README). Pozostałe "
"aktualizacje instalują się normalnie."

#. TRANSLATORS: why an update was not installed, after its name and version in the list of
#. those not installed (lower case, no full stop); {folder}: the folder the device hides from
#. the file manager, e.g. GARMIN/Prompts
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"the device keeps it in the folder {folder}, hidden from the file manager, "
"and openExpress cannot open a direct USB connection to this device to write "
"there (the Flatpak version needs access to USB devices for it)"
msgstr ""
"urządzenie trzyma ją w folderze {folder}, ukrytym przed menedżerem plików, "
"a openExpress nie może otworzyć bezpośredniego połączenia USB z tym "
"urządzeniem, aby tam zapisać (wersja Flatpak potrzebuje do tego dostępu do "
"urządzeń USB)"

#. TRANSLATORS: after updates were copied: the head of the list of those that were not
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{count} update was not installed:"
msgid_plural "{count} updates were not installed:"
msgstr[0] "Nie zainstalowano {count} aktualizacji:"
msgstr[1] "Nie zainstalowano {count} aktualizacji:"
msgstr[2] "Nie zainstalowano {count} aktualizacji:"

#. TRANSLATORS: an update not installed and why ({why}: the error's words)
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "update not installed"
msgid "{name} {version}: {why}"
msgstr "{name} {version}: {why}"

#. TRANSLATORS: `openexpress updates`: the device keeps its software in a folder openExpress
#. cannot see over MTP; {folder}: e.g. .System
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"openExpress cannot see the folder {folder}, where this device keeps its "
"software, so it installs nothing there. Some devices, such as car "
"navigators, hide it from the file manager."
msgstr ""
"openExpress nie widzi folderu {folder}, w którym to urządzenie trzyma swoje "
"oprogramowanie, więc niczego tam nie instaluje. Niektóre urządzenia, np. "
"nawigacje samochodowe, ukrywają go przed menedżerem plików."

#. TRANSLATORS: after the device's own software was written into the folder a car navigator
#. hides: it installs it once unplugged, and must not lose power meanwhile
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Keep the device powered until it has installed its software: connect it to "
"its car cable or a USB charger, or make sure its battery is well charged."
msgstr ""
"Urządzenie musi mieć zasilanie, dopóki nie zainstaluje oprogramowania: "
"podłącz je kablem samochodowym lub do ładowarki USB albo upewnij się, że "
"bateria jest dobrze naładowana."

#. TRANSLATORS: `openexpress updates`: items Garmin offers to add to the device (voices,
#. vehicles) that it does not have
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} add-on that is not on the device is not listed: openExpress does not "
"install add-ons yet."
msgid_plural ""
"{count} add-ons that are not on the device are not listed: openExpress does "
"not install add-ons yet."
msgstr[0] ""
"Pominięto {count} dodatek, którego nie ma na urządzeniu: openExpress jeszcze "
"nie instaluje dodatków."
msgstr[1] ""
"Pominięto {count} dodatki, których nie ma na urządzeniu: openExpress jeszcze "
"nie instaluje dodatków."
msgstr[2] ""
"Pominięto {count} dodatków, których nie ma na urządzeniu: openExpress "
"jeszcze nie instaluje dodatków."

#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Not in the list: {items}"
msgstr "Brak na liście: {items}"

#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The server gave a name that cannot be used as a path on this computer: "
"“{name}”"
msgstr ""
"Serwer podał nazwę, której nie można użyć jako ścieżki na tym komputerze: "
"„{name}”"

#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{part}: the server did not provide a download URL"
msgstr "{part}: serwer nie podał adresu URL do pobrania"

#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{part}: the RGN format is not supported by openExpress"
msgstr "{part}: format RGN nie jest obsługiwany przez openExpress"

#. TRANSLATORS: a step: the small file of information about an update ({name}) is
#. downloaded ("… · 1.2 MB of 3.4 MB")
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Downloading the update information of {name}"
msgstr "Pobieranie informacji o aktualizacji {name}"

#. TRANSLATORS: a step: the small file of information about an update ({name}) is
#. copied to the device
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Copying the update information of {name} to the device"
msgstr "Kopiowanie informacji o aktualizacji {name} na urządzenie"

#. TRANSLATORS: a step: the small file of information about an update ({name}) is read
#. back from the device and compared
#: openexpress/updates.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Checking the update information of {name} on the device"
msgstr "Sprawdzanie informacji o aktualizacji {name} na urządzeniu"

#. TRANSLATORS: title of a notification of the background sync:
#. the first sync of a device waits for the user's choice
#: openexpress/watch.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{device}: choose how to sync it first"
msgstr "{device}: najpierw wybierz sposób synchronizacji"

#: openexpress/watch.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Open openExpress and choose how to sync the device."
msgstr "Otwórz openExpress i wybierz sposób synchronizacji urządzenia."

#. TRANSLATORS: title of the notification while the background service
#. syncs; {device}: the device's name
#: openexpress/watch.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Syncing {device}"
msgstr "Synchronizowanie {device}"

#. TRANSLATORS: notification body while the watch is syncing
#: openexpress/watch.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "In progress…"
msgstr "W toku…"

#. TRANSLATORS: title of a notification of the background sync, over what it did
#: openexpress/watch.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{device} synced"
msgstr "Zsynchronizowano urządzenie {device}"

#. TRANSLATORS: title of a notification of the background sync, over why
#: openexpress/watch.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{device} not synced"
msgstr "Nie zsynchronizowano urządzenia {device}"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Manage your Garmin device on Linux"
msgstr "Zarządzaj urządzeniem Garmin na Linuksie"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"openExpress is an unofficial Linux app for Garmin watches and bike computers "
"connected with a USB cable. It syncs them with Garmin Connect and installs "
"software updates, maps, Connect IQ apps and music."
msgstr ""
"openExpress to nieoficjalna aplikacja dla Linuksa do zegarków i liczników "
"rowerowych Garmin podłączonych kablem USB. Synchronizuje je z Garmin Connect "
"oraz instaluje aktualizacje oprogramowania, mapy, aplikacje Connect IQ "
"i muzykę."

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Upload new activities, sleep, HRV and other data to Garmin Connect"
msgstr ""
"Wysyłanie nowych aktywności, snu, HRV i innych danych do Garmin Connect"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Send courses, workouts and Connect IQ apps queued in Garmin Connect to the "
"device"
msgstr ""
"Przesyłanie na urządzenie kursów, treningów i aplikacji Connect IQ z kolejki "
"Garmin Connect"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Install and update software and free maps such as TopoActive, and copy maps "
"of your own"
msgstr ""
"Instalacja i aktualizacja oprogramowania oraz darmowych map, np. TopoActive, "
"i kopiowanie własnych map"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Copy courses from GPX files to the device, without Garmin Connect "
"(experimental)"
msgstr ""
"Kopiowanie kursów z plików GPX na urządzenie, bez Garmin Connect "
"(eksperymentalne)"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Install, update and remove Connect IQ apps, turn them on or off and put them "
"back in order"
msgstr ""
"Instalacja, aktualizacja i usuwanie aplikacji Connect IQ, ich włączanie "
"i wyłączanie oraz przywracanie kolejności"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Copy music, podcasts and audiobooks, with playlists"
msgstr "Kopiowanie muzyki, podcastów i audiobooków, z listami odtwarzania"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"See each activity on its own page: the track on a map, charts, laps, heart "
"rate zones and training effect"
msgstr ""
"Każda aktywność na osobnej stronie: trasa na mapie, wykresy, okrążenia, "
"strefy tętna i efekt treningu"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"See the device's crashes, software updates and storage, and free up space "
"taken by older memory dumps and updates it did not install"
msgstr ""
"Podgląd awarii urządzenia, aktualizacji oprogramowania i pamięci oraz "
"zwalnianie miejsca zajętego przez starsze zrzuty pamięci i niezainstalowane "
"aktualizacje"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Keep the GPS satellite data of some devices current without the phone "
"(experimental)"
msgstr ""
"Aktualizowanie danych satelitarnych GPS niektórych urządzeń bez telefonu "
"(eksperymentalne)"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"See the batteries of the sensors on your Garmin Connect account and the "
"solar charging of a device"
msgstr ""
"Podgląd baterii czujników na koncie Garmin Connect i ładowania słonecznego "
"urządzenia"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Make backups of the device"
msgstr "Kopie zapasowe urządzenia"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Sync in the background whenever the device is connected"
msgstr "Synchronizacja w tle przy każdym podłączeniu urządzenia"

#. TRANSLATORS: a feature in the description for software centres: the program sends no
#. usage data
#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "No telemetry"
msgstr "Bez telemetrii"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"The one-time setup reads the data needed to talk to Garmin's servers from "
"your own copy of the official Garmin Express installer for Windows. "
"openExpress is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by Garmin Ltd. "
"Garmin, fēnix, Garmin Connect and Garmin Express are trademarks of Garmin "
"Ltd. or its subsidiaries."
msgstr ""
"Jednorazowa konfiguracja odczytuje dane potrzebne do komunikacji z serwerami "
"Garmina z Twojej kopii oficjalnego instalatora Garmin Express dla Windows. "
"openExpress nie jest powiązany z Garmin Ltd., nie jest przez nią "
"zatwierdzony ani wspierany. Garmin, fēnix, Garmin Connect i Garmin Express "
"są znakami towarowymi Garmin Ltd. lub jej spółek zależnych."

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"The page of an activity: its track on a map coloured by elevation, and its "
"elevation profile"
msgstr ""
"Strona aktywności: trasa na mapie w kolorach wysokości i profil wysokości"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"The start page: the devices connected and those seen before, with labels "
"such as Update available"
msgstr ""
"Strona startowa: podłączone urządzenia i te widziane wcześniej, z etykietami "
"takimi jak „Dostępna aktualizacja”"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Software updates: the device software and two more updates offered for it"
msgstr ""
"Aktualizacje oprogramowania: oprogramowanie urządzenia i dwie inne "
"aktualizacje dla niego dostępne"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"The device page: the sensors on the Garmin Connect account with their "
"batteries, and solar charging"
msgstr ""
"Strona urządzenia: czujniki z konta Garmin Connect z ich bateriami "
"i ładowanie słoneczne"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Maps on the device and free maps to install"
msgstr "Mapy na urządzeniu i darmowe mapy do zainstalowania"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Connect IQ apps"
msgstr "Aplikacje Connect IQ"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Music, podcasts and audiobooks"
msgstr "Muzyka, podcasty i audiobooki"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Activities of the device and of its backups, with their sport, time, "
"distance and ascent"
msgstr ""
"Aktywności urządzenia i jego kopii zapasowych, z dyscypliną, czasem, "
"dystansem i przewyższeniem"

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Device Status: the device's crashes in the last 30 days and its storage by "
"kind of file"
msgstr ""
"Stan urządzenia: awarie urządzenia w ostatnich 30 dniach i pamięć według "
"rodzaju plików"
